"Denis B. Roegel" writes:
 >
 > Good day,
 >
 > I encountered a case where a bad font size
 > is asked for.
 >
 > When I write
 >
 > \documentstyle[12pt]{article}
 > \begin{document}
 > {\tiny\tt something}
 > \end{document}
 >
 > I ask for OT1/cmtt/m/n at 7pt,
 > according to the definition of tiny in art12.sty.

The definition of \tiny in art12.sty specifies 6pt fonts with 7pt
\baselineskip.

\def\tiny{\@setsize\tiny{7pt}\vipt\@vipt}


